      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "Special thanks to our jumpscare TRex. \nHonestly we all put in a ton of
    work\nWe all preformed outside of \nthe scopes stated to the left here.\nWe took
    special care to make sure\nthat we all worked collaboratively\nand effectively
    when we chose to.\nDespite our bad Git hub issues we \nencountered both at the
    start of\nthis course and midway through\nwe all adapted and did our best \nto
    overcome the unfortunate \ncircumstances that occured due to\nissues outside
    our knowledge scope."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
